{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1066057/block/singleImage/3279872/df/01M8DC3FFXJ15CS16W0Y181KR0.jpg?updatedAt=1795745268\"/><figcaption>警方灣仔警區特別職務隊聯同入境處展開掃黃行動，突擊搜查皇后大道東及駱克道多個樓上單位，拘捕10名年齡介乎16至45歲的內地女子，涉嫌違反逗留條件。(警方圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>警方灣仔警區特別職務隊聯同入境處，根據線報及深入調查，周四（26日）下午在灣仔區展開代號「虎尾」的掃黃行動，突擊搜查皇后大道東及駱克道多個樓上單位。 行動中，人員拘捕10名年齡介乎16至45歲的內地女子，涉嫌違反逗留條件。所有被捕人士現正被扣留調查，稍後交由入境處跟進。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T03:43:58.129375+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":215,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T02:07:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T23:17:31.706348+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T03:37:15.035267+00:00","content_hash":"9a67530a5025b8259b2c7a5ea0c2d3bbd0750f15dfc9fed777da5fb812c7df4f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T03:43:58.129375+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}